{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run to the Rhythm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scuttle</strong> is a high-speed <strong>third-person platformer</strong> with <strong>rhythm game</strong> elements that blends music and momentum across vibrant, ocean-inspired worlds. In this genre-bending adventure, you play as a crab on a musical journey, <strong>gaining speed by hitting notes on beat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/extras/c901ccddd70ff542e3c6c32be056d75c.poster.avif?t=1772985749\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/extras/c901ccddd70ff542e3c6c32be056d75c.webm?t=1772985749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/extras/c901ccddd70ff542e3c6c32be056d75c.mp4?t=1772985749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Charms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the blue musical charms to progress and trigger new sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/extras/53fe9905de65db270fa7ea9fbf9bfb8a.poster.avif?t=1772985749\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/extras/53fe9905de65db270fa7ea9fbf9bfb8a.webm?t=1772985749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/extras/53fe9905de65db270fa7ea9fbf9bfb8a.mp4?t=1772985749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Ocean</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through unique beach-inspired biomes, from sunlit shores and open waters to volcanic coasts and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/extras/e1896b85251ab459a21af2c6c3e9cbd3.poster.avif?t=1772985749\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/extras/e1896b85251ab459a21af2c6c3e9cbd3.webm?t=1772985749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/extras/e1896b85251ab459a21af2c6c3e9cbd3.mp4?t=1772985749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dodge Obstacles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade urchins, lava, cliffs, and other hazards to maintain your speed and rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/extras/a004d4910ed776045f94ff83a5f54e23.poster.avif?t=1772985749\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/extras/a004d4910ed776045f94ff83a5f54e23.webm?t=1772985749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/extras/a004d4910ed776045f94ff83a5f54e23.mp4?t=1772985749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Platform On Beat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger platforming mechanics by jumping to the beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/extras/78de6b650b9c5c7376892ed048791750.poster.avif?t=1772985749\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/extras/78de6b650b9c5c7376892ed048791750.webm?t=1772985749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/extras/78de6b650b9c5c7376892ed048791750.mp4?t=1772985749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run to the Beat of a Soulful Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery behind this world and discover the true nature of flow.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/extras/eb62dfa556465b0b89b0e57feaf95a03.avif?t=1772985749\" width=1560 height=611 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2766810?t=1772985749","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/e7b1f364839584662f12491afed46a7d1daa625a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772985749","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/27700b45c1c67e8461bde1e6f74caea049d2a42c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772985749","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766810/27700b45c1c67e8461bde1e6f74caea049d2a42c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772985749","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3278200,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run to the Rhythm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scuttle</strong> is a high-speed <strong>third-person pl